{"exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"y":-220,"x":240,"mirrow":false,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara007_1","addImg":"chara007_1_face_chara007_1g"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"y":-220,"x":240,"mirrow":false,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara007_1","addImg":"chara007_1_face_chara007_1g"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"拉碧丝","text":"[show]擅长的舞蹈啊……{myName}难道是想对我进行专访吗？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara007_1_face_chara007_1b"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"拉碧丝","text":"[show]我在妖精战争开始前，是在部族里领跳祝祷舞的。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"拉碧丝","text":"[show]但自从开始经营妖精舞台，我就在琢磨怎么表演客人喜欢看的舞蹈。[r]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara007_1_face_chara007_1f"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"拉碧丝","text":"[show]深渊里的人们喜欢的舞种，作为可靠的前辈，我多少都得会一些吧。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"拉碧丝","text":"[show]结果到了最后，每种好像都不是特别擅长……可能我的练习也还没到家吧，哈哈。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara007_1_face_chara007_1c"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"拉碧丝","text":"[show]偶尔还会想起跳祝祷舞的那些日子，但我现在更喜欢和舞团的各位一起练习精进。[r]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"拉碧丝","text":"[show]以后也要来看我们的演出哦，{myName}。[l][cm][hide]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_8"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"y":-220,"x":24